             means of pmPdhFrameHopCDThresholdDataInstance)."
::= { opticsIMPdhFrameHopThresholdDataEntry 9 }


opticsIMPdhFrameHopThrIndexNext OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX OpticsIMThrIndexNext2
       MAX-ACCESS read-only
       STATUS current
       DESCRIPTION
            "See Textual Conventions (in this case it is applied to PDH  Frame Hop Section)."
::= { opticsIMPdhPmMibObject 7 }


