       DESCRIPTION
            "The number of SES. "
       DEFVAL {0} 
::= { opticsIME1CurrentDataEntry 9 }

pmE1CDUas OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX Gauge32
       MAX-ACCESS read-create
